<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>

    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Pati3.31">
        <l>imaiya varampaṉ ṟampi yamaivara</l>
        <l>vumpaṟ kāṭṭait taṉkō ṉiṟīi</l>
        <l>yakappā veṟintu pakaṟṟī vēṭṭu</l>
        <l>matiyuṟaḻ marapiṉ mutiyarait taḻīik</l>
        <l>kaṇṇakaṉ vaippiṉ maṇvakut tīttup</l> <!-- changed tīttuk to tīttup, because in the next line R changed the text, but forgot to change the sandhi; what to do in these cases? introduce a new variant? add a note? -->
        <l>peruṅkaḷiṟṟi yāṉaip puṇarnirai nīṭṭi</l>
        <l>yirukaṭa ṉīru morupaka lāṭi</l>
        <l>yayirai paraii yāṟṟalcāṉ muṉpō</l>
        <l>ṭoṭuṅkā nallicai yuyarnta kēḷvi</l>
        <l>neṭumpā ratāyaṉār muntuṟak kāṭupōnta</l>
        <l>palyāṉaic celkeḻu kuṭṭuvaṉaip</l>
        <l><persName xml:lang="ta">pālaik kautamaṉār</persName> pāṭiṉār pattuppāṭṭu</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>translation line</l>
        <l>translation line</l>
      </lg>
    </div>

    <div rend="parallel">
    <p xml:id="Pati3.31coda1">
      avaitām: aṭuneyyāvuti, kayiṟukuṟumukavai, tataintakāñci, cīrcāl veḷḷi, kāṉuṇaṅku kaṭuneṟi, kāṭuṟu kaṭuneṟi toṭarnta kuvaḷai, uruttuvaru malirniṟai, veṇkai makaḷir, pukaṉṟa vāyam; ivai pāṭṭiṉ patikam.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
    
    <div rend="parallel">
     <p xml:id="Pati3.31coda2">
      pāṭip peṟṟa paricil: ‘nīr vēṇṭiyatu koṇmiṉ’ eṉa, ‘yāṉum eṉ pārppa ṉiyum cuvark kam pukal vēṇṭum’ eṉa, pārppāriṟ periyōraik kēṭṭu oṉpatu peru vēḷvi vēṭpikkap pattām peruvēḷviyiṟ pārppāṉaiyum pārppaṉiyaiyum kāṇārāyiṉār.imayavarampaṉ ṟampi palyāṉaiccel keḻukuṭṭuvaṉ irupattai yāṇṭu vīṟṟiruntāṉ.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>

